if mibBuilder.loadTexts: vRtrLdpIfPassiveMode.setDescription("The value of vRtrLdpIfPassiveMode specifies the mode used for setting\n         up LDP sessions. This object is meaningful only in case of LDP\n         targeted peers and not for interfaces. When it has a value of 'true',\n         LDP responds only when it gets a connect request from a peer and will\n         not attempt to actively connect to its neighbors. When it has a value\n         of 'false', LDP actively tries to connect to its peers.\n\n         This object was obsoleted in release 13.0.")
