if mibBuilder.loadTexts: vRtrLdpIfStatsTable.setDescription('vRtrLdpIfStatsTable is a read-only table. The purpose of this table is\n         to keep statistical information about the LDP Interfaces and Targeted\n         peers on the LSR.\n\n         Use of AUGMENTS clause implies a one-to-one dependent relationship\n         between the base table, vRtrLdpIfTable, and the augmenting table,\n         vRtrLdpIfStatsTable. This in effect extends the vRtrLdpIfTable with\n         additional columns. Creation or deletion of a row in the\n         vRtrLdpIfTable results in the same fate for the row in the\n         vRtrLdpIfStatsTable.\n\n         In 13.0 this table has been replaced by\n         TIMETRA-LDP-NG-MIB::vRtrLdpNgInetIfStatsTable.')
