if mibBuilder.loadTexts: vRtrLdpStaticFecIngLabel.setDescription('The value of vRtrLdpStaticFecIngLabel specifies the label that is\n         advertised to the upstream peer.\n\n         The range of vRtrLdpStaticFecIngLabel is dynamic and depends on the\n         value of vRtrMplsLabelStaticLabelRange.\n\n         The normal range of vRtrLdpStaticFecIngLabel starts at 32 and ends at\n         the value of vRtrMplsLabelStaticLabelRange + 32.\n\n         If this variable is set to the default value of 4294967295, the\n         ingress label will be dynamically assigned by the label manager.\n\n         This object was obsoleted in release 13.0.')
